    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert forensic accountant who takes both emails and attachments to figure out the context therein. Your goal is to help create a thoughtful record and log of the detail in your executives inbox.\n\nBasics:\nExtract the vendor name, invoice amount, and due date from the email/attachment below. Respond with these as fields labeled Vendor Name (as text), Invoice Amount (as number), Currency (as currency type e.g,, USD, EUR, GBP, JPY etc.), and Due Date (as date).\n\nIf there's additional Product/Service Detail on what the invoice is for (e.g., product or services), list that out in bulleted text for better formatting.\n\nSometimes the invoice states that there are multiple payment due dates. If this is true, state yes-otherwise leave as no.\n\nIf there are payment details (e.g., credit card, wire information, ach information) extract those as text with appropriate formatting (e.g., often time there are addresses, different hard enter lines etc.)\n\nFinally if there is additional context to note (e.g., sometimes there's an attachment with a password), provide context in a text.\n\nEmail / attachment content:\n---\n{{ $json.emailText }}\n---",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
